<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 78,410.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 78,410.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of December 12 totaled 78,410 bales, up from 76,997 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,417 bales issued, no decertification orders, four cancellations, and 849 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
